#. Manual context: Node Wrangler, ../../manual/addons/node_wrangler.rst:75
#. Current Blender UI: NODE_MT_nw_merge_nodes_menu.
msgid "Merge Selected Nodes"
msgstr "Sammanfoga valda noder"

#. Manual context: Node Wrangler, ../../manual/addons/node_wrangler.rst:157.
#. "Geometry to Instance" is the translated Blender node name.
msgid "Merge Using Geometry to Instance Node"
msgstr "Sammanfoga med noden Geometri till instans"

#. Manual context: Node Wrangler, ../../manual/addons/node_wrangler.rst:161.
#. Current Blender UI translates "Geometry Nodes" as "Geometrinoder".
msgid ":guilabel:`Geometry Nodes`"
msgstr ":guilabel:`Geometrinoder`"

#. Manual context: Node Wrangler, ../../manual/addons/node_wrangler.rst:162.
#. Menu labels follow the current Blender UI terminology.
msgid ""
":menuselection:`Node Wrangler --> Merge Selected Nodes --> Use Geometry "
"Nodes --> Use Geometry to Instance Nodes`"
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Node Wrangler --> Sammanfoga valda noder --> Använd "
"geometrinoder --> Använd noderna Geometri till instans`"

#. Manual context: Node Wrangler, ../../manual/addons/node_wrangler.rst:164.
msgid ""
"Connects the Geometry outputs of the selected nodes to a :doc:`Geometry to "
"Instance Node </modeling/geometry_nodes/geometry/geometry_to_instance>`."
msgstr ""
"Ansluter geometriutdata från de markerade noderna till en :doc:`Geometri "
"till instans-nod </modeling/geometry_nodes/geometry/geometry_to_instance>`."

#. Manual context: Node Wrangler, ../../manual/addons/node_wrangler.rst:167.
msgid ""
"Unlike Join Geometry, which combines the input geometry, Geometry to "
"Instance creates a separate instance for each input. This preserves the "
"individual geometry components as instances, allowing them to be transformed "
"or processed together without combining their underlying geometry."
msgstr ""
"Till skillnad från Sammanfoga geometri, som kombinerar indatageometrin, "
"skapar Geometri till instans en separat instans för varje indata. Detta "
"bevarar de enskilda geometrikomponenterna som instanser, så att de kan "
"transformeras eller bearbetas tillsammans utan att den underliggande "
"geometrin kombineras."

#. Manual context: Node Wrangler, ../../manual/addons/node_wrangler.rst:362.
#. Current Blender UI translates "Reset Nodes" as "Återställ noder".
msgid ":menuselection:`Node --> Reset Nodes`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Nod --> Återställ noder`"

#. Manual context: Node Wrangler, ../../manual/addons/node_wrangler.rst:494.
msgid "Center Nodes"
msgstr "Centrera noder"

#. Manual context: Node Wrangler, ../../manual/addons/node_wrangler.rst:498.
msgid ":menuselection:`Sidebar --> Node Wrangler --> Center Nodes`"
msgstr ":menuselection:`Sidofält --> Node Wrangler --> Centrera noder`"

#. Manual context: Node Wrangler, ../../manual/addons/node_wrangler.rst:500.
msgid "Move selected nodes to the center of the node editor."
msgstr "Flyttar markerade noder till mitten av nodredigeraren."

#. Manual context: Node Wrangler, ../../manual/addons/node_wrangler.rst:544.
msgid ""
":menuselection:`Add --> Input Add Image Sequence` "
"for :guilabel:`Compositor`, or :menuselection:`Add --> Texture Add Image "
"Sequence` for :guilabel:`Shader`"
msgstr ""
":menuselection:`Lägg till --> Indata --> Bildsekvens` "
"för :guilabel:`Kompositering`, eller :menuselection:`Lägg till --> Textur --"
"> Bildsekvens` för :guilabel:`Shader`"

#. Manual context: Node Wrangler, ../../manual/addons/node_wrangler.rst:551.
msgid ""
"Sets the file path to be relative to the currently opened blend-file. "
"See :ref:`files-blend-relative_paths`."
msgstr ""
"Anger att filsökvägen ska vara relativ till den blend-fil som är öppen. "
"Se :ref:`files-blend-relative_paths`."

#. Manual context: Rigify basics, ../../manual/addons/rigify/basics.rst:76.
msgid ""
"For more tips, see the :doc:`Positioning Guide </addons/rigify/"
"bone_positioning>`."
msgstr ""
"Fler tips finns i :doc:`Positioneringsguiden </addons/rigify/"
"bone_positioning>`."

#. Manual context: Rigify basics, ../../manual/addons/rigify/basics.rst:103.
#. UI labels follow the current Blender UI export.
msgid ""
"Then, always in the Properties click on the Armatures tab and under display "
"check the *Axis* checkbox. This way the bones rotation axes will be "
"displayed during the edit process."
msgstr ""
"Klicka sedan i Egenskaper på fliken Armaturer och markera kryssrutan *Axel* "
"under visning. Benens rotationsaxlar visas då under redigeringen."

#. Manual context: Rigify basics, ../../manual/addons/rigify/basics.rst:156.
msgid ""
"To bind the geometry to the rig you can use your preferred tools. Just a few "
"things you have to know:"
msgstr ""
"För att binda geometrin till riggen kan du använda valfria verktyg. Du "
"behöver bara känna till några saker:"

#. Manual context: Rigify basics, ../../manual/addons/rigify/basics.rst:161.
msgid ""
"Usually armature deform with automatic weights does a really good job out of "
"the box if you correctly place your bones (and there is enough topology to "
"work with!)."
msgstr ""
"Armaturdeformering med automatiska vikter fungerar vanligen mycket bra "
"direkt, om du placerar benen rätt och det finns tillräcklig topologi att "
"arbeta med."

#. Manual context: Rigify basics, ../../manual/addons/rigify/basics.rst:204.
msgid "Otherwise, ``RIG-`` is prefixed to the name."
msgstr "I annat fall får namnet prefixet ``RIG-``."

#. Manual context: Rigify basics, ../../manual/addons/rigify/basics.rst:220.
#. Current Blender UI translates "Target Rig" as "Målrigg".
msgid ""
"This option specifies the generated script data block to overwrite when re-"
"generating, and works in the same manner as *Target Rig*."
msgstr ""
"Det här alternativet anger vilket genererat skriptdatablock som ska skrivas "
"över vid omgenerering och fungerar på samma sätt som *Målrigg*."

#. Manual context: Rigify basics, ../../manual/addons/rigify/basics.rst:245.
#. Current Blender UI uses this exact translation.
msgid "Post Generation"
msgstr "Efter generering"

#. Manual context: Rigify bone positioning, ../../manual/addons/rigify/bone_positioning.rst:35.
msgid ""
"Keeping aligned the mid bones in \"brow\", \"brow.b\", \"lid.t\", \"lid.b\" "
"and cheek will give better results after rig generation."
msgstr ""
"Att hålla mittbenen i \"brow\", \"brow.b\", \"lid.t\", \"lid.b\" och "
"\"cheek\" i linje ger bättre resultat efter genereringen av riggen."

#. Manual context: Rigify external add-on packages, ../../manual/addons/rigify/feature_sets.rst:4.
#. Current Blender UI: Feature Set = funktionsuppsättning.
msgid "Feature Sets"
msgstr "Funktionsuppsättningar"

#. Manual context: Rigify external add-on packages, ../../manual/addons/rigify/feature_sets.rst:6.
msgid ""
"Rigify allows third party developers to implement sub-addons, called "
"*Feature Sets*, which can provide new :doc:`Meta-Rigs </addons/rigify/"
"metarigs>` and :doc:`Rig Types </addons/rigify/rig_types/index>`. Similar to "
"regular add-ons, they can be installed from zip-files through Rigify "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Rigify gör det möjligt för tredjepartsutvecklare att implementera "
"undertillägg, så kallade *funktionsuppsättningar*, som kan tillhandahålla "
"nya :doc:`metariggar </addons/rigify/metarigs>` och :doc:`riggtyper </addons/"
"rigify/rig_types/index>`. Liksom vanliga tillägg kan de installeras från zip-"
"filer via Rigifys inställningar."

#. Manual context: Rigify external add-on packages, ../../manual/addons/rigify/feature_sets.rst:11.
msgid ""
"These are some examples of *Feature Sets* currently provided by past and "
"current Rigify developers:"
msgstr ""
"Här är några exempel på *funktionsuppsättningar* som tidigare och nuvarande "
"Rigify-utvecklare tillhandahåller:"

#. Manual context: Rigify meta-rigs, ../../manual/addons/rigify/metarigs.rst:110.
msgid ""
"At the top of the panel you can find a field specifying the rig type for the "
"active bone. The drop-down list can be optionally filtered by "
"the :doc:`Feature Set </addons/rigify/feature_sets>` it belongs to."
msgstr ""
"Längst upp i panelen finns ett fält som anger riggtypen för det aktiva "
"benet. Listrutan kan vid behov filtreras efter "
"den :doc:`funktionsuppsättning </addons/rigify/feature_sets>` som benet "
"tillhör."

#. Manual context: Rigify meta-rigs, ../../manual/addons/rigify/metarigs.rst:272.
msgid "Button Text"
msgstr "Knapptext"

#. Manual context: Rigify meta-rigs, ../../manual/addons/rigify/metarigs.rst:273.
msgid ""
"This field can be used to override the text used on the UI button to be "
"distinct from the true collection name. Unlike collection names, button text "
"is not required to be unique, so this can be used to reduce clutter by "
"relying on contextual cues within the panel."
msgstr ""
"Det här fältet kan användas för att åsidosätta texten på gränssnittsknappen "
"så att den skiljer sig från samlingens egentliga namn. Till skillnad från "
"samlingsnamn behöver knapptexter inte vara unika. Det kan minska röran genom "
"att använda sammanhanget i panelen."

#. Manual context: glTF GPU instancing, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:58.
msgid ""
"When the option is enabled in Exporter, instances are exported using the "
"``EXT_mesh_gpu_instancing`` extension. There are some limitations, at export:"
msgstr ""
"När alternativet är aktiverat i exportören exporteras instanser med "
"tillägget ``EXT_mesh_gpu_instancing``. Vid export gäller några begränsningar:"

#. Manual context: glTF material image maps, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:88.
msgid ""
"An example of the various image maps available in the glTF 2.0 core format. "
"This is the `water bottle sample model <https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-"
"Sample-Models/tree/main/2.0/WaterBottle>`__ shown alongside slices of its "
"various image maps."
msgstr ""
"Ett exempel på de olika bildmappningar som finns i kärnformatet glTF 2.0. "
"Det här är `vattenflaskans exempelmodell <https://github.com/KhronosGroup/"
"glTF-Sample-Models/tree/main/2.0/WaterBottle>`__ som visas tillsammans med "
"utsnitt av dess olika bildmappningar."

#. Manual context: glTF base color from an AO node, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:143.
msgid ""
"From an Ambient Occlusion node connected to the *Base Color* input. (The AO "
"socket is not used in glTF, but the color output can be used as a base "
"color.)"
msgstr ""
"Från en Ambient Occlusion-nod som är ansluten till ingången *Base Color*. "
"(AO-uttaget används inte i glTF, men färgutdata kan användas som basfärg.)"

#. Manual context: glTF normal maps, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:328.
msgid ""
"Note that the *tangent* socket must be linked to a *tangent* node, with "
"UVMap. The chosen UVMap must be the UVMap of the Normal Map."
msgstr ""
"Observera att uttaget *tangent* måste vara länkat till en *tangent*-nod med "
"UVMap. Den valda UVMap:en måste vara samma som för Normal Map."

#. Manual context: glTF KHR_materials_dispersion, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:409.
msgid ""
"Dispersion can be exported only if the material also uses the "
"``KHR_materials_volume`` extension. Data will be exported using the "
"``KHR_materials_dispersion`` extension. The dispersion socket of the custom "
"group node ``glTF Material Output`` is used for this extension."
msgstr ""
"Dispersion kan bara exporteras om materialet även använder tillägget "
"``KHR_materials_volume``. Data exporteras med tillägget "
"``KHR_materials_dispersion``. Dispersionsuttaget i den anpassade gruppnoden "
"``glTF Material Output`` används för tillägget."

#. Manual context: glTF KHR_materials_iridescence, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:415.
#. Svenska Akademiens ordböcker records the Swedish technical noun "iridescens".
msgid "Iridescence"
msgstr "Iridescens"

#. Manual context: glTF KHR_materials_iridescence, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:417.
msgid ""
"Iridescence can be exported using the ``KHR_materials_iridescence`` "
"extension. Data will be exported using the following nodes:"
msgstr ""
"Iridescens kan exporteras med tillägget ``KHR_materials_iridescence``. Data "
"exporteras med följande noder:"

#. Manual context: glTF KHR_materials_iridescence, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:420.
msgid ""
"Iridescence Thickness Maximum can be plugged into the Thickness socket of "
"custom group node ``glTF Material Output``. If a texture is used, it must be "
"plugged on (``R``) Red channel of the image."
msgstr ""
"Maximal iridescenstjocklek kan anslutas till uttaget Thickness i den "
"anpassade gruppnoden ``glTF Material Output``. Om en textur används måste "
"den anslutas till bildens röda kanal (``R``)."

#. Manual context: glTF KHR_materials_iridescence, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:423.
msgid ""
"Iridescence IOR can be plugged into the Thin Film IOR socket of Principled "
"BSDF node."
msgstr ""
"Iridescensens IOR kan anslutas till uttaget Thin Film IOR i noden Principled "
"BSDF."

#. Manual context: glTF KHR_materials_iridescence, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:424.
msgid ""
"Iridescence Factor can be plugged into the thickness socket of Principled "
"BSDF node."
msgstr ""
"Iridescensfaktorn kan anslutas till tjockleksuttaget i noden Principled BSDF."

#. Manual context: glTF KHR_materials_iridescence, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:425.
msgid ""
"Iridescence Maximum Thickness can be plugged into the Iridescence Thickness "
"Maximum socket of custom group node ``glTF Material Output``"
msgstr ""
"Maximal iridescenstjocklek kan anslutas till uttaget Iridescence Thickness "
"Maximum i den anpassade gruppnoden ``glTF Material Output``"

#. Manual context: glTF KHR_materials_iridescence, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:428.
msgid ""
"Texture for Iridescence Factor can be plugged on (``R``) Red channel of an "
"image plugged into this socket. You can use a Multiply node to multiply this "
"texture with the Iridescence Factor value."
msgstr ""
"Texturen för iridescensfaktorn kan anslutas till den röda kanalen (``R``) i "
"en bild som är ansluten till uttaget. Du kan använda en Multiply-nod för att "
"multiplicera texturen med värdet för Iridescence Factor."

#. Manual context: glTF KHR_materials_iridescence, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:430.
msgid ""
"Texture for Iridescence Thickness can be plugged on (``G``) Green channel of "
"an image, used as a mix factor for thickness between Minimum and Maximum "
"thickness."
msgstr ""
"Texturen för iridescenstjocklek kan anslutas till den gröna kanalen (``G``) "
"i en bild och användas som blandningsfaktor för tjockleken mellan minsta och "
"största tjocklek."

#. Manual context: glTF material settings, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:496.
#. Current Blender UI: Backface Culling = borttagning av baksidor.
msgid ""
"For materials where only the front faces will be visible, turn on *Backface "
"Culling* (Camera) in the *Settings* panel of an EEVEE material. When using "
"other engines (Cycles, Workbench) you can temporarily switch to EEVEE to "
"configure this setting, then switch back."
msgstr ""
"För material där endast framsidorna ska synas aktiverar du *Backface "
"Culling* (Camera) i panelen *Inställningar* för ett EEVEE-material. När du "
"använder andra renderingsmotorer, som Cycles eller Workbench, kan du "
"tillfälligt växla till EEVEE för att konfigurera inställningen och sedan "
"växla tillbaka."

#. Manual context: glTF alpha mask cutoff, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:527.
msgid ""
"Rounding snaps alpha values that are 0.5 or greater up to 1, and ones below "
"0.5 down to 0. It is also possible to use a cutoff value different than 0.5 "
"by using Math nodes to do ``1 - (alpha < cutoff)``."
msgstr ""
"Avrundning snäpper alfavärden på minst 0,5 till 1 och värden under 0,5 till "
"0. Du kan också använda ett annat tröskelvärde än 0,5 genom att använda Math-"
"noder för att beräkna ``1 - (alpha < cutoff)``."

#. Manual context: glTF punctual lights, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:619.
msgid ""
"The glTF format supports three types of punctual lights: point, spot, and "
"directional (Sun in Blender). Blender's Area light type and World lighting "
"are not supported by glTF, and will be ignored during export."
msgstr ""
"Formatet glTF har stöd för tre typer av punktljus: punktljus, spotlights och "
"riktat ljus (Sun i Blender). Blenders områdesljus och världsbelysning stöds "
"inte av glTF och ignoreras vid export."

#. Manual context: glTF punctual lights, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:627.
msgid "Light Color"
msgstr "Ljusfärg"

#. Manual context: glTF punctual lights, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:629.
msgid "The color of a glTF light is determined by the product of:"
msgstr "Färgen på ett glTF-ljus bestäms av produkten av:"

#. Manual context: glTF punctual lights, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:631.
msgid "The color field on the light object, and"
msgstr "Färgfältet på ljusobjektet, och"

#. Manual context: glTF punctual lights, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:632.
msgid ""
"The color output of an Emission shader node, if the light is using nodes and "
"has an Emission shader connected to its output."
msgstr ""
"Färgutdata från en Emission-shadernod, om ljuset använder noder och har en "
"Emission-shader ansluten till sin utdata."

#. Manual context: glTF punctual lights, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:635.
msgid ""
"If you are using EEVEE render engine, only the color field on the light "
"object is used, and Emission shader node is ignored. (This reflects Viewport "
"rendering)"
msgstr ""
"Om du använder renderingsmotorn EEVEE används bara färgfältet på "
"ljusobjektet och Emission-shadern ignoreras. (Detta motsvarar renderingen i "
"visningsområdet.)"

#. Manual context: glTF punctual lights, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:640.
msgid "Light Intensity"
msgstr "Ljusintensitet"

#. Manual context: glTF punctual lights, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:642.
msgid ""
"For Sun lights, the intensity is determined by the strength field on the "
"light object. For Point and Spot lights, the intensity can also be "
"determined by the Strength socket of a Light Falloff Node."
msgstr ""
"För Sun-ljus bestäms intensiteten av fältet Strength på ljusobjektet. För "
"Point- och Spot-ljus kan den också bestämmas av uttaget Strength på en Light "
"Falloff-nod."

#. Manual context: glTF punctual lights, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:645.
msgid ""
"If you are using EEVEE render engine, the node setup will be ignored, and "
"only the strength field on the light object is used."
msgstr ""
"Om du använder renderingsmotorn EEVEE ignoreras noduppsättningen och bara "
"fältet Strength på ljusobjektet används."

#. Manual context: registered glTF extension identifier, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:671, 694.
msgid "``KHR_materials_dispersion``"
msgstr "``KHR_materials_dispersion``"

#. Manual context: registered glTF extension identifier, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:678, 699.
msgid "``EXT_meshopt_compression``"
msgstr "``EXT_meshopt_compression``"

#. Manual context: registered glTF extension identifier, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:679, 700.
msgid "``KHR_meshopt_compression``"
msgstr "``KHR_meshopt_compression``"

#. Manual context: registered glTF extension identifier, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:680, 701.
msgid "``KHR_animation_pointer``"
msgstr "``KHR_animation_pointer``"

#. Manual context: glTF animation example, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:745.
msgid ""
"This is the `fox sample model <https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Sample-"
"Models/tree/main/2.0/Fox>`__ showing its \"Run\" animation."
msgstr ""
"Det här är `rävexempelmodellen <https://github.com/KhronosGroup/glTF-Sample-"
"Models/tree/main/2.0/Fox>`__ som visar sin \"Run\"-animation."

#. Manual context: glTF action export, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:803.
#. Current Blender UI translates Action Slot as åtgärdsslot.
msgid ""
"Before Blender 4.4, tracks were merged regarding their name. With Blender "
"4.4, and the introduction of slotted actions, this default behavior has been "
"changed. Now, tracks are merged by the action they are using, and not by "
"their name. You can find more information about action slots "
"in :doc:`Animation </animation/actions>`."
msgstr ""
"Före Blender 4.4 sammanfogades spår efter namn. I Blender 4.4 ändrades "
"standardbeteendet i och med införandet av åtgärder med slotar. Nu "
"sammanfogas spår efter den åtgärd de använder, inte efter namn. Mer "
"information om åtgärdsslotar finns i :doc:`Animation </animation/actions>`."

#. Manual context: glTF animation extension, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:852.
msgid "Animation Pointer"
msgstr "Animationspekare"

#. Manual context: glTF animation extension, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:854.
msgid ""
"Animation Pointer is a way to export some properties of a material, or a "
"light, or a camera, as an animation. This is an experimental feature."
msgstr ""
"Animationspekare är ett sätt att exportera vissa egenskaper hos ett "
"material, ett ljus eller en kamera som en animation. Funktionen är "
"experimentell."

#. Manual context: glTF animation extension, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:857.
msgid ""
"Custom Properties (extras in glTF) can be animated, but only for 1 composant "
"data for now (float, int, bool)."
msgstr ""
"Anpassade egenskaper (extras i glTF) kan animeras, men för närvarande bara "
"för data med en komponent (float, int, bool)."

#. Registered glTF extension identifier, ../../manual/addons/scene_gltf2.rst:662.
msgid "``KHR_materials_pbrSpecularGlossiness``"
msgstr "``KHR_materials_pbrSpecularGlossiness``"

